---
layout: base.njk
title: "Products — Nirmaan"
description: "Products Nirmaan builds and runs: Nirmaan Outreach, which finds the customers who need you and writes to them like a person, and IP Nirmaan, semiconductor IP built as software."
ogDescription: "Nirmaan Outreach and IP Nirmaan: systems we built for our own work, offered as products."
permalink: "/products.html"
nav: "products"
head:
  eyebrow: "Our products"
  lines: ["Systems we built", "for ourselves first."]
  accent: 1
  lede: "Most of what we build belongs to our clients. These are ours: systems we made for our own work and now offer to other businesses."
  glyph: "11111/10001/11111/10001/11111"
cta:
  eyebrow: "Something else in mind?"
  lines: ["Need a system", "nobody sells?"]
  text: "Most problems don't fit a product. Tell us yours, and we'll build the system around how your business runs."
  primary: { label: "Tell us your problem", href: "/contact.html" }
  secondary: { label: "See our services", href: "/services.html" }
---
<section class="section" aria-label="Products">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="product-grid" role="list">
      {%- for p in products %}
      <li class="product-card" data-reveal style="--d: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        <div class="product-card__top">
          {% glyph p.glyph, "product-card__glyph" %}
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ p.label }}</p>
        </div>
        <h2 class="product-card__name display">
          <a href="{{ p.href }}"{% if not p.external %} data-morph="product-{{ p.id }}"{% endif %}>{{ p.name }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="product-card__tagline">{{ p.tagline }}</p>
        <p class="product-card__text">{{ p.text }}</p>
        <p class="product-card__more mono" aria-hidden="true">{% if p.external %}{{ p.href | replace("https://", "") | replace("/", "") }} ↗{% else %}See it work →{% endif %}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
